<title>UK: Cydsa prices $200 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cydsa prices $200 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Citibank International Plc, has been priced</p>
<p> BORROWER   CYDSA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     9.375     MATURITY    23.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.591    PAY DATE  S-25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  **	  REOFFER    99.951    SPREAD	+320 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT MAY 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
